{"content_hash": "d865622373bfaa8f", "version_id": 973, "article_id": 98, "level_code": "en_b1", "lang": "en", "level": 3, "level_label": "B1 中级", "title": "Nvidia CEO exit and robot hype send 39 China stocks to daily limit", "title_zh": "英伟达CEO辞职叠加机器人炒作退潮，39只A股跌停", "has_translation": true, "topic": "business", "source": "tmtpost", "source_url": "https://www.tmtpost.com/8205442.html", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517422688858-c17ab068121c?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8Y2hpbmElMjBzdG9ja3MlMjBmYWxsfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTQ3MDUwOTl8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Kido Dong on Unsplash", "author": "Kido Dong", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@likeakid?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/panoramic-photography-of-cn-tower-toronto-canada-1wZ5i0yhHiA?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(193, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(231, 46%, 48%)", "label": "BUSINESS", "seed": "efd1712d6bc7"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-15", "word_count": 191, "reading_minutes": 1.0, "lead": "On November 13, all five major Chinese stock indexes closed lower, and 39 stocks hit their daily limit down. Three of them had risen on hype rather than profit, and now the market is taking that back.", "lead_zh": "11月13日，中国五大股指全线收跌，39只股票跌停。其中三只此前靠炒作而非业绩上涨，如今市场正在把溢价收回去。", "preview": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35, while the ChiNext index dropped 3.32 percent. Trading value shrank by 276 billion yuan, and", "preview_zh": "上证指数下跌0.59%，报3634.35点，创业板指则大跌3.32%。成交额缩量2760亿元，下跌个股达4748只，上涨仅765只。抛售同时打击了科技股和概念股，因为英伟达宣布黄仁勋将卸任首席执行官。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 956, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b1.mp3", "duration": 77.475, "size_bytes": 465840, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 78.9, "size_bytes": 474336, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 84.675, "size_bytes": 509040, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 72.95, "size_bytes": 438624, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/98/en_b1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 78.175, "size_bytes": 470016, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 214, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/98/en_b1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@3ac86e1e/content/data/versions/973.json", "paragraphs": ["The Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35, while the ChiNext index dropped 3.32 percent. Trading value shrank by 276 billion yuan, and 4,748 stocks fell against only 765 that rose. The selling hit both tech and concept shares, because Nvidia said Jensen Huang would step down as CEO.", "Nanwei shares, which makes bandages and protective products, fell after a run driven by flu and mask themes. Although revenue dropped nearly 10 percent this year, the stock still trades far above its fair value. Turnover stayed under 5 percent after the limit down, so sellers may not be finished.", "Xiangyang Bearing hit its limit down after eight straight days of gains. The company itself warned that its robot reducer bearings bring in very little revenue. It has lost money for three years, so the rally was built on talk rather than results.", "Daye shares also closed limit down. Its humanoid robot tendon rope is still only being tested, with no orders or sales. The company swung to a loss of 116 million yuan this quarter, and trading volume fell 30 percent. Investors should wait for real orders before judging the price."], "paragraphs_zh": ["上证指数下跌0.59%，报3634.35点，创业板指则大跌3.32%。成交额缩量2760亿元，下跌个股达4748只，上涨仅765只。抛售同时打击了科技股和概念股，因为英伟达宣布黄仁勋将卸任首席执行官。", "主营创可贴和防护用品的南卫股份，在流感与口罩题材推动上涨后跌停。尽管今年收入下降近一成，股价仍远高于合理估值。跌停后换手率不足5%，说明卖压可能还没结束。", "襄阳轴承在连续八个涨停后跌停。公司自己提示，其机器人减速器轴承收入占比极低。公司已连亏三年，这波上涨靠的是故事而非业绩。", "大业股份同样收于跌停。其人形机器人腱绳仍处于送样测试阶段，没有订单也没有收入。公司本季度由盈转亏1.16亿元，成交量下降三成。投资者应等待真实订单再判断股价。"], "body": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35, while the ChiNext index dropped 3.32 percent. Trading value shrank by 276 billion yuan, and 4,748 stocks fell against only 765 that rose. The selling hit both tech and concept shares, because Nvidia said Jensen Huang would step down as CEO.\n\nNanwei shares, which makes bandages and protective products, fell after a run driven by flu and mask themes. Although revenue dropped nearly 10 percent this year, the stock still trades far above its fair value. Turnover stayed under 5 percent after the limit down, so sellers may not be finished.\n\nXiangyang Bearing hit its limit down after eight straight days of gains. The company itself warned that its robot reducer bearings bring in very little revenue. It has lost money for three years, so the rally was built on talk rather than results.\n\nDaye shares also closed limit down. Its humanoid robot tendon rope is still only being tested, with no orders or sales. The company swung to a loss of 116 million yuan this quarter, and trading volume fell 30 percent. Investors should wait for real orders before judging the price.", "body_zh": "上证指数下跌0.59%，报3634.35点，创业板指则大跌3.32%。成交额缩量2760亿元，下跌个股达4748只，上涨仅765只。抛售同时打击了科技股和概念股，因为英伟达宣布黄仁勋将卸任首席执行官。\n\n主营创可贴和防护用品的南卫股份，在流感与口罩题材推动上涨后跌停。尽管今年收入下降近一成，股价仍远高于合理估值。跌停后换手率不足5%，说明卖压可能还没结束。\n\n襄阳轴承在连续八个涨停后跌停。公司自己提示，其机器人减速器轴承收入占比极低。公司已连亏三年，这波上涨靠的是故事而非业绩。\n\n大业股份同样收于跌停。其人形机器人腱绳仍处于送样测试阶段，没有订单也没有收入。公司本季度由盈转亏1.16亿元，成交量下降三成。投资者应等待真实订单再判断股价。", "text": "The Shanghai index fell 0.59 percent to 3634.35, while the ChiNext index dropped 3.32 percent. Trading value shrank by 276 billion yuan, and 4,748 stocks fell against only 765 that rose. The selling hit both tech and concept shares, because Nvidia said Jensen Huang would step down as CEO. Nanwei shares, which makes bandages and protective products, fell after a run driven by flu and mask themes. Although revenue dropped nearly 10 percent this year, the stock still trades far above its fair value. Turnover stayed under 5 percent after the limit down, so sellers may not be finished. Xiangyang Bearing hit its limit down after eight straight days of gains. The company itself warned that its robot reducer bearings bring in very little revenue. It has lost money for three years, so the rally was built on talk rather than results. Daye shares also closed limit down. Its humanoid robot tendon rope is still only being tested, with no orders or sales. The company swung to a loss of 116 million yuan this quarter, and trading volume fell 30 percent. Investors should wait for real orders before judging the price.", "vocab": [{"word": "limit down", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "跌停", "note": "股市术语，指股价跌到当日 allowed 的最低点", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "index", "pos": "noun", "zh": "指数", "note": "复数 indexes 或 indices", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "shrink", "pos": "verb", "zh": "缩水；减少", "note": "常与 by 连用表示减少的幅度", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "concept share", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "概念股", "note": "靠题材炒作而非业绩的股票", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hype", "pos": "noun", "zh": "炒作；夸大